(c) Only for phase-to-phase faults  
(d) Depends on source impedance

**Answer: (a) Yes (within reach)**

**Solution:**

Relay reach = 80% of 100km = 80km
Fault at 70% = 70km
Since 70km < 80km, the relay will operate.

**Alternative Questions:**
