| 03 | 33 | KEY-FIXED | (b) ±0.5 Hz | (a) ±1 Hz | `sinc(2t) ↔ ½Π(f/2)` — time compression expands bandwidth |
| 03 | 63 | BROKEN SOURCE | (a) 0<K<6 | K > 0, unbounded | Second-order system; upper limit in option (a) is spurious |
